{"id":"4e6344487b1da6c9","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-system-f-church-iteration.md","title":"Church数码的类型与计算","display":"thm-system-f-church-iteration — Church数码的类型与计算","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-system-f-church-iteration","aliases":["72-thm-system-f-church-iteration"],"display":"thm-system-f-church-iteration — Church数码的类型与计算","depends_on":["[[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]]","[[72-lem-system-f-substitution]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.V §10 and Ch.X polymorphism; complete local typing/reduction calculation","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-system-f-church-iteration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-system-f-church-iteration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-system-f-church-iteration — Church数码的类型与计算"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c1cc99c8ec1e8071\" href=\"?note=c1cc99c8ec1e8071\" title=\"72-df-system-f-church-numerals\">72-df-system-f-church-numerals</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6061af339630925b\" href=\"?note=6061af339630925b\" title=\"72-lem-system-f-substitution\">72-lem-system-f-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.V §10 and Ch.X polymorphism; complete local typing/reduction calculation"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_F\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_F\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_F F:A\\to A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_F F:A\\to A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_F X:A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_F X:A\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{It}_n,\\mathsf c_n,\\mathsf{Nat}_F\">\\(\\operatorname{It}_n,\\mathsf c_n,\\mathsf{Nat}_F\\)</span> 使用所引定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\vdash_F\\mathsf c_n:\\mathsf{Nat}_F.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varnothing\\vdash_F\\mathsf c_n:\\mathsf{Nat}_F.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_F\\mathsf c_n[A]FX:A,\\qquad\n\\langle\\mathsf c_n[A]FX,\\operatorname{It}_n(F,X)\\rangle\\in\\beta_F^*.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_F\\mathsf c_n[A]FX:A,\\qquad\n\\langle\\mathsf c_n[A]FX,\\operatorname{It}_n(F,X)\\rangle\\in\\beta_F^*.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先对n归纳，在 f:U→U,x:U 的上下文中，每次应用保持结果类型U；两次项抽象及一次类型抽象给第一式，类型引入的旁条件由空外部上下文成立。类型应用把U换成A，再两次项β将f、x同时替换为F、X；捕获避免及α改名确保有限迭代的语法恰是 It_n(F,X)。这个局部计算证明不依赖 System F 的一般强正规化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-system-f-church-numerals","status":"resolved","id":"c1cc99c8ec1e8071","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-system-f-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"6061af339630925b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-system-f-substitution]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_F","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_F F:A\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_F X:A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{It}_n,\\mathsf c_n,\\mathsf{Nat}_F","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing\\vdash_F\\mathsf c_n:\\mathsf{Nat}_F.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_F\\mathsf c_n[A]FX:A,\\qquad\n\\langle\\mathsf c_n[A]FX,\\operatorname{It}_n(F,X)\\rangle\\in\\beta_F^*.","display":true}],"bytes":1576,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-94","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增11项：[[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]] · [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]] · [[72-ex-per-union-not-transitive]] · [[72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence]] · [[72-thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-preevaluation-live-support]] · [[72-thm-system-f-church-iteration]] · [[72-thm-system-f-empty-type]] · [[72-thm-vper-directed-union]] · [[72-thm-vper-lattice-bounds]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-90","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增11项：[[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]] · [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]] · [[72-ex-per-union-not-transitive]] · [[72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence]] · [[72-thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-preevaluation-live-support]] · [[72-thm-system-f-church-iteration]] · [[72-thm-system-f-empty